 saved, so can you pull up the Corbridge entry in my locker — just the entry, not the password.\", \"Oh hang on, while I think of it, can you look up Blanka for me? I can never remember how they're saved.\", \"Different thing — I was clearing out my list earlier and got rid of the giraffe task, and I shouldn't have, so could you bring it back?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0011\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what the actual Corbridge password is, please?\"], [\"umm what's the, uh, the actual Corbridge password again?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0015\", \"v\": [[\"ok so the alarm code is 42358, can you, uh, keep that in the locker?\"], [\"We've just had the alarm redone and I know I'll forget it by next week, so could you save it in the locker for me — the alarm code is 42358.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0016\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please move the tapestry task to saturday and the totem fitting to sunday?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me who's coming to it?\", \"Would you mind adding a task for me to email Dragan tomorrow?\"], [\"umm can you move the tapestry thing to saturday and, uh, the totem fitting to sunday?\", \"ok and who's… who's coming to it?\", \"oh, uh, can you make me a to-do to email Dragan tomorrow?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0017\", \"v\": [[\"umm who's coming to the, uh, the lastet?\", \"ok and what's their, like, their number?\", \"oh different thing, can you add the umbrella picture to the Rummy meetup album?\"], [\"who's at the lastet?\", \"their number?\", \"umbrella pic into Rummy meetup album\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0018\", \"v\": [[\"I have a feeling I booked something there but I honestly can't remember — is there a calendar event at Paphos Yard?\", \"Different thing — I'm getting ready for practice, so could you show me the notes in my Bagpipes notebook?\", \"Also, I want to print a few for the fridge, so what pictures have I got from this month?\", \"Oh and I want to double-check I've got the right details saved — can you find Ylva Lamont in my contacts?\"], [\"Could you check whether there's a calendar event at Paphos Yard, please?\", \"Could you show me the notes in my Bagpipes notebook, please?\", \"Would you mind showing me the photos I have from this month?\", \"Could you please find Ylva Lamont in my contacts?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0019\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me the totem entries in my spending, please?\", \"Sorry, quick question — what's in my Garden folder?\", \"Thank you. Going back to the spending entry, how much was it?\"], [\"I'm doing a bit of budgeting before the new year, so can you pull up the totem entries from my spending?\", \"Oh wait, before I forget, what's in my Garden folder? I need a paper from there later.\", \"Ok, back to the spending thing from before — how much was that one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0020\", \"v\": [[\"starfish fair, who's coming to that\", \"wait quick one, anything with Blanka in my tasks?\", \"ok back to the fair, can u get me Brelleth's contact details\"], [\"I'm sorting out food for the starfish fair and need a headcount — who is actually coming?\", \"Hang on, sorry, something just popped into my head — are there any Blanka tasks? I have a feeling I promised something.\", \"Right, back to the fair guest list — can I get Brelleth's contact details? I'd like to check they're still ok to come.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w17-0021\", \"v\": [[\"starfish fair — when?\", \"what's under Bank?\", \"bin the energy one\", \"no, the third one\"], [\"I've completely lost track of dates with the holidays, so the starfish fair — when is it again?\", \"Different thing, I'm trying to get my paperwork in order — what have I got filed under Bank?\", \"That's an old bill I don't need any more, so could you bin the energy one?\", \"Oh no, wrong one — I actually meant the third one, sorry, I'm getting muddled today.\"]]}","ttft_ms":33346,"type":"result","duration_ms":49195,"uuid":"f0992b39-5581-4083-8d08-a50f7a73ecad","ttft_stream_ms":1359,"time_to_request_ms":148,"first_content_frame_ms":1359,"time_to_request_f